			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> </p><p>I left out of principle, but Twitter isn't the same as it was a year or so. There's nothing to go back to.</p><p>At any rate, I'm enjoying the 2008 Twitter vibe here on Mastodon much more than I was enjoying 2022 Twitter.</p>",
